# MOVEMENT II — A' b61-84 and Coda b85-96, Eb major.
# b61-68 cantilena in ob1+fl1 (unison), vn1 16th filigree, va the sixths
# counterline, pizz CELL-major bass. b69-76 vn1 sings it an octave up,
# vc (arco, tenor register) takes the sixths line, cb pizz bass, fg
# doubles it. b77-84 approach and deceptive (b81 Cm) re-cadence, f.
# Coda b85-96: the CELL augmented to quarters in the horns (Eb horns +
# Bb-horn d4 in hocket) over the pizz CELL; cl1 then fl1 say farewell
# with the cantilena head; plagal close over an Eb pedal.

