  next_bar: Movement III b1   key: G minor   meter 3/4
  tempo: Menuetto. Allegro molto, dotted half = 80 (one in a bar)
  Movement II ends b96: winds hold Eb chord pp with fermata (fl1 eb5, ob
  (g4 bb4), cl (bb3 eb4), fg eb2, hn12 (eb3 eb4)); strings pizz Eb chord
  on beat 1 (vn1 eb4-bb4-g5, vn2 g3-eb4, va bb3, vc eb2, cb eb1->eb2),
